4.0.1 Question 1

Restyle the following pipelines following the guidelines above.



Code
flights|&gt;filter(dest=="IAH")|&gt;group_by(year,month,day)|&gt;summarize(n=n(),
delay=mean(arr_delay,na.rm=TRUE))|&gt;filter(n&gt;10)

flights|&gt;filter(carrier=="UA",dest%in%c("IAH","HOU"),sched_dep_time&gt;
0900,sched_arr_time&lt;2000)|&gt;group_by(flight)|&gt;summarize(delay=mean(
arr_delay,na.rm=TRUE),cancelled=sum(is.na(arr_delay)),n=n())|&gt;filter(n&gt;10)


Solution:

This code shows a summary of the number of flights along with the average delay on each day from NYC to IAH with a selection of days where those flights were greater than 10.



Code
flights |&gt; 
  filter(dest=="IAH") |&gt; 
  group_by(year,month,day) |&gt; 
  summarize(n=n(),delay=mean(arr_delay,na.rm=TRUE)) |&gt; 
  filter(n&gt;10)




Code
flights |&gt; 
  filter(carrier=="UA",
         dest%in%c("IAH","HOU"),
         sched_dep_time&gt;0900,
         sched_arr_time&lt;2000) |&gt; 
  group_by(flight) |&gt; 
  summarize(delay=mean(arr_delay,na.rm=TRUE),
            cancelled=sum(is.na(arr_delay)),
            n=n()) |&gt; 
  filter(n&gt;10)
